 "sentences": [
  "He ordered soldiers to fire on a crowd.",
  "Neal Dow was known as the Father of Prohibition.",
  "Born in 1804, he believed alcohol caused society's problems.",
  "He became Portland's mayor and banned alcohol sales statewide.",
  "But in 1855, his opponents rioted against his strict rules.",
  "Dow ordered the state militia to fire, killing one man.",
  "Public anger forced him out of office shortly after."
